{"seq":1,"slug":"code-distribution-registry","title":"代码分发与 Registry 模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/design-systems/patterns/code-distribution-registry","wordCount":917,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"代码分发与-registry-模式\">代码分发与 Registry 模式</h1><p>2026 年设计系统的分发方式正经历根本性转变。传统的 npm 包依赖模式——install → import → 受制于上游版本——正在被 shadcn/ui 开创的&quot;代码分发&quot;（code distribution）模式取代。Registry 模式让团队直接拥有组件源码，同时保留了统一分发和版本追踪的工程价值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>代码分发的核心理念：组件代码不是&quot;消费的依赖&quot;，而是&quot;安装的起点&quot;。安装后，代码属于你的项目，你可以自由修改、删除、扩展——不存在上游 breaking change 的风险。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 传统模式&#10;        NR[npm Registry] --&gt;|install| NM[node_modules]&#10;        NM --&gt;|import| APP1[App Code]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Registry 模式&#10;        REG[Component Registry] --&gt;|copy| SRC[src/components/ui/]&#10;        SRC --&gt;|owns| APP2[App Code]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph 传统模式\n        NR[npm Registry] --&gt;|install| NM[node_modules]\n        NM --&gt;|import| APP1[App Code]\n    end\n    subgraph Registry 模式\n        REG[Component Registry] --&gt;|copy| SRC[src/components/ui/]\n        SRC --&gt;|owns| APP2[App Code]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对比维度</th>\n<th>npm 包依赖</th>\n<th>代码分发（Registry）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>所有权</td>\n<td>库作者</td>\n<td>消费方（你）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>升级方式</td>\n<td><code>npm update</code></td>\n<td>按需手动 diff + merge</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Breaking change</td>\n<td>被动承受</td>\n<td>主动选择</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>定制能力</td>\n<td>Override / 主题配置</td>\n<td>直接修改源码</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Bundle 影响</td>\n<td>可能包含未用代码</td>\n<td>只有安装的组件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类型安全</td>\n<td>取决于库导出</td>\n<td>完全控制</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"shadcn-ui-registry-的工程实现\">shadcn/ui Registry 的工程实现</h2><p>shadcn/ui 的 registry 不仅是&quot;复制粘贴&quot;——它是一套完整的组件分发基础设施：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 初始化项目配置（框架、样式方案、路径）&#10;npx shadcn@latest init&#10;&#10;# 从官方 registry 安装组件&#10;npx shadcn@latest add button dialog form data-table&#10;&#10;# 从社区 registry 安装&#10;npx shadcn@latest add https://ui.shadcn.com/r/sidebar&#10;npx shadcn@latest add https://originui.com/r/calendar\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 初始化项目配置（框架、样式方案、路径）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> shadcn@latest</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> init</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 从官方 registry 安装组件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> shadcn@latest</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> button</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> dialog</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> form</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> data-table</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 从社区 registry 安装</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> shadcn@latest</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> https://ui.shadcn.com/r/sidebar</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> shadcn@latest</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> https://originui.com/r/calendar</span></span></code></pre></div><p>安装一个组件时 CLI 做的事情：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>从 registry 获取组件定义（源码 + 依赖声明）</li>\n<li>将源码写入 <code>components/ui/</code> 目录</li>\n<li>安装必要的 npm 依赖（如 <code>@radix-ui/react-dialog</code>）</li>\n<li>解析并安装依赖的其他内部组件（如 Button 依赖的 utils）</li>\n</ol>\n<p>组件安装后的文件结构：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"src/&#10;├── components/&#10;│   └── ui/&#10;│       ├── button.tsx        ← 你拥有的源码&#10;│       ├── dialog.tsx&#10;│       ├── form.tsx&#10;│       └── data-table.tsx&#10;├── lib/&#10;│   └── utils.ts              ← cn() 工具函数&#10;└── app.css                    ← Token CSS 变量\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>src/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── components/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── ui/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       ├── button.tsx        ← 你拥有的源码</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       ├── dialog.tsx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       ├── form.tsx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│       └── data-table.tsx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── lib/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── utils.ts              ← cn() 工具函数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└── app.css                    ← Token CSS 变量</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"构建私有-registry\">构建私有 Registry</h2><p>对于企业级设计系统，建立内部私有 registry 是 shadcn 模式规模化的关键：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;name&quot;: &quot;acme-ui&quot;,&#10;  &quot;homepage&quot;: &quot;https://ui.acme.internal&quot;,&#10;  &quot;registries&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;ui&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;url&quot;: &quot;https://ui.acme.internal/r&quot;,&#10;      &quot;style&quot;: &quot;default&quot;&#10;    }&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;items&quot;: [&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;name&quot;: &quot;button&quot;,&#10;      &quot;dependencies&quot;: [&quot;@radix-ui/react-slot&quot;, &quot;class-variance-authority&quot;],&#10;      &quot;registryDependencies&quot;: [&quot;utils&quot;],&#10;      &quot;files&quot;: [&#10;        {&#10;          &quot;path&quot;: &quot;ui/button.tsx&quot;,&#10;          &quot;type&quot;: &quot;registry:ui&quot;&#10;        }&#10;      ]&#10;    }&#10;  ]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"acme-ui\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"homepage\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://ui.acme.internal\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"registries\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"ui\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"url\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://ui.acme.internal/r\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"style\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"default\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"items\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"button\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"dependencies\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"@radix-ui/react-slot\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"class-variance-authority\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"registryDependencies\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"utils\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"files\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"path\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ui/button.tsx\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"registry:ui\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Registry 能力</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>版本追踪</td>\n<td>记录每个组件的安装版本，支持 diff 对比</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>依赖解析</td>\n<td>自动安装组件间的内部依赖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多风格支持</td>\n<td>同一组件可提供多种视觉风格</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>框架适配</td>\n<td>根据目标项目输出对应框架代码</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自定义转换</td>\n<td>支持安装时的代码转换（如路径别名）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"registry-模式的治理挑战\">Registry 模式的治理挑战</h2><p>代码分发带来自由的同时也引入了治理难题：</p>\n<p><strong>版本漂移</strong>：团队 A 安装后大量修改了 Button，团队 B 的 Button 保持原样——两个产品的 Button 不再一致。</p>\n<p>应对策略：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    R[Internal Registry v2.3] --&gt;|install| T1[Team A Button v2.3]&#10;    R --&gt;|install| T2[Team B Button v2.3]&#10;    T1 --&gt;|customize| T1M[Team A Modified Button]&#10;    R --&gt;|upgrade v2.4| T2U[Team B Button v2.4]&#10;    T1M -.-&gt;|drift detected| ALERT[治理告警]\">graph TD\n    R[Internal Registry v2.3] --&gt;|install| T1[Team A Button v2.3]\n    R --&gt;|install| T2[Team B Button v2.3]\n    T1 --&gt;|customize| T1M[Team A Modified Button]\n    R --&gt;|upgrade v2.4| T2U[Team B Button v2.4]\n    T1M -.-&gt;|drift detected| ALERT[治理告警]</pre><ol>\n<li><strong>定期 diff 审计</strong>：CI 定期对比各项目的组件与 registry 最新版的差异</li>\n<li><strong>分层定制约束</strong>：标记哪些文件允许修改（如样式类）、哪些不应该动（如行为逻辑）</li>\n<li><strong>升级建议</strong>：registry 发布新版时，向已安装的项目推送可选 diff patch</li>\n<li><strong>合规检查</strong>：确保关键行为（无障碍、安全）未被修改破坏</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"何时选择-npm-包-vs-registry\">何时选择 npm 包 vs Registry</h2><p>两种模式不是互斥的。根据组织需求可以混合使用：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>推荐方式</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>底层原语（Radix）</td>\n<td>npm 包</td>\n<td>行为复杂、不应修改、需要持续安全更新</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>UI 组件（Button/Dialog）</td>\n<td>Registry</td>\n<td>需要品牌定制、视觉调整频繁</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>工具函数（cn/utils）</td>\n<td>npm 包或 Registry</td>\n<td>稳定且共享</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>业务模式（LoginForm）</td>\n<td>Registry</td>\n<td>业务逻辑高度定制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>图标集</td>\n<td>npm 包</td>\n<td>纯数据、不需定制</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>代码分发模式将组件所有权从库作者转移到消费方</li>\n<li>shadcn/ui 的 registry CLI 提供完整的分发基础设施（依赖解析、版本追踪）</li>\n<li>企业通过私有 registry 实现 shadcn 模式的规模化</li>\n<li>版本漂移是 registry 模式的核心治理挑战，需要 diff 审计 + 分层约束</li>\n<li>npm 包与 registry 可混合使用：原语用包、UI 组件用 registry</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"../implementation/component-api-design\">组件 API 设计与组合模式</a> — Registry 分发的组件 API 设计约束</li>\n<li><a href=\"storybook-documentation\">Storybook 组件文档化</a> — 分发后的组件如何文档化</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../frontend-design-tokens-systems/pipeline/token-formats\">Token 格式与构建转换</a> — Token 层的分发与同步机制</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"代码分发与 Registry 模式","id":"代码分发与-registry-模式"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"shadcn/ui Registry 的工程实现","id":"shadcn-ui-registry-的工程实现"},{"level":2,"text":"构建私有 Registry","id":"构建私有-registry"},{"level":2,"text":"Registry 模式的治理挑战","id":"registry-模式的治理挑战"},{"level":2,"text":"何时选择 npm 包 vs Registry","id":"何时选择-npm-包-vs-registry"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"变体与主题工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/design-systems/implementation/variant-theming-engineering"},"next":{"title":"Storybook 组件文档化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/design-systems/patterns/storybook-documentation"}}